('wikiloc', '109614910', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/el-cable-horcada-de-cain-tiro-del-oso-hoyo-grande-collada-blanca-veronica-fuente-de-109614910', 'El Cable - Horcada de Cain - TIRO DEL OSO - Hoyo Grande - Collada Blanca - Veronica - Fuente De', '{"en":"One way from El Cable to Fuente Dé","ca":"Un sol sentit d''El Cable a Fuente Dé","es":"Un solo sentido de El Cable a Fuente Dé"}'::jsonb, 'El Cable - Horcada de Cain - TIRO DEL OSO - Hoyo Grande - Collada Blanca - Veronica - Fuente De Hiking trail in Fuente Dé, Cantabria (España). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This challenging one-way route for experts begins at El Cable, accessible by cable car, and traverses towards Horcada de Caín. The route then ascends to Tiro del Oso, offering significant elevation gain and technical terrain.\n\nFrom Tiro del Oso, it continues across Hoyo Grande and Collada Blanca, passing Refugio Verónica before a long descent. The trail concludes at Fuente Dé, making it a demanding high-mountain traverse suitable only for experienced mountaineers.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta d''anada només per a experts comença a El Cable, accessible amb telefèric, i travessa cap a Horcada de Caín. La ruta ascendeix després al Tiro del Oso, oferint un desnivell significatiu i terreny tècnic.\n\nDes del Tiro del Oso, continua per Hoyo Grande i Collada Blanca, passant pel Refugi Verónica abans d''un llarg descens. El camí conclou a Fuente Dé, convertint-la en una travessa d''alta muntanya exigent apta només per a muntanyencs experimentats.","es":"Esta exigente ruta de ida solo para expertos comienza en El Cable, accesible en teleférico, y atraviesa hacia Horcada de Caín. La ruta asciende luego al Tiro del Oso, ofreciendo un desnivel significativo y terreno técnico.\n\nDesde Tiro del Oso, continúa por Hoyo Grande y Collada Blanca, pasando por el Refugio Verónica antes de un largo descenso. El camino concluye en Fuente Dé, convirtiéndola en una travesía de alta montaña exigente apta solo para montañeros experimentados."}'::jsonb, 'Ecco2208', 22161, 1604, 2398, 2640, 1162, 'only-experts', 'one-way', 28200, 37680, 3939, '2022-08-02', '2022-07', '[{"lat":43.158539,"lng":-4.808394,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158584,"lng":-4.808435,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158622,"lng":-4.808488,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158667,"lng":-4.808499,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158722,"lng":-4.808526,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158773,"lng":-4.808547,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158821,"lng":-4.808584,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158865,"lng":-4.808618,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.15891,"lng":-4.808651,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158953,"lng":-4.80871,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.158986,"lng":-4.808758,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159025,"lng":-4.808813,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159051,"lng":-4.808864,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159091,"lng":-4.80891,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159124,"lng":-4.808955,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159161,"lng":-4.808998,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159216,"lng":-4.809061,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159268,"lng":-4.809109,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159317,"lng":-4.809152,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159353,"lng":-4.809197,"ele":1963},{"lat":43.159393,"lng":-4.809247,"ele":1947.1},{"lat":43.159444,"lng":-4.809262,"ele":1947.9},{"lat":43.159489,"lng":-4.809283,"ele":1948.3},{"lat":43.159531,"lng":-4.809313,"ele":1948.8},{"lat":43.159573,"lng":-4.809345,"ele":1949.1},{"lat":43.159617,"lng":-4.809375,"ele":1949.2},{"lat":43.159659,"lng":-4.809408,"ele":1949.3},{"lat":43.159708,"lng":-4.809438,"ele":1949.7},{"lat":43.159758,"lng":-4.809456,"ele":1950.3},{"lat":43.159805,"lng":-4.809467,"ele":1951},{"lat":43.159856,"lng":-4.809478,"ele":1951.8},{"lat":43.159912,"lng":-4.809483,"ele":1952.6},{"lat":43.159966,"lng":-4.809476,"ele":1953.3},{"lat":43.160017,"lng":-4.809446,"ele":1954.1},{"lat":43.16006,"lng":-4.809404,"ele":1954.8},{"lat":43.160086,"lng":-4.809348,"ele":1955.4},{"lat":43.160103,"lng":-4.809289,"ele":1955.8},{"lat":43.160123,"lng":-4.8