('wikiloc', '113964432', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/torre-de-la-pardida-y-pico-boada-113964432', 'Torre de la Párdida and Pico Boada', '{"en":"Circular from Pandébano via Jou Cerredo","ca":"Circular des de Pandébano per Jou Cerredo","es":"Circular desde Pandébano por Jou Cerredo"}'::jsonb, 'Torre de la párdida y pico boada Hiking trail in Sotres, Asturias (España). Download its GPS track and follow the itinerary on a map. Pandébano, urriellu, horcada arenera, torre de la párdida, jou cerredo, horcada don Carlos, pico boada, bajada por horcada cain, jou sin tierre, urriellu, Pandébano', '{"en":"This demanding 23.4 km loop with 2032m of elevation gain starts from Pandébano, offering a challenging day in the Picos de Europa. The route ascends to Refugio Urriellu before reaching Horcada Arenera, then continues to the summits of Torre de la Párdida and Pico Boada.\n\nThe descent navigates through Jou Cerredo, Horcada Don Carlos, Horcada Caín, and Jou Sin Tierre, returning via Refugio Urriellu and Pandébano. This long and strenuous route requires excellent physical condition and experience in mountain terrain.","ca":"Aquesta exigent ruta circular de 23,4 km amb 2032m de desnivell positiu comença des de Pandébano, oferint un dia desafiant als Picos de Europa. La ruta ascendeix al Refugi Urriellu abans d''arribar a l''Horcada Arenera, i després continua cap als cims de la Torre de la Párdida i el Pico Boada.\n\nEl descens transcorre per Jou Cerredo, Horcada Don Carlos, Horcada Caín i Jou Sin Tierre, tornant via Refugi Urriellu i Pandébano. Aquesta ruta llarga i extenuant requereix una excel·lent condició física i experiència en terreny de muntanya.","es":"Esta exigente ruta circular de 23,4 km con 2032m de desnivel positivo comienza desde Pandébano, ofreciendo un día desafiante en los Picos de Europa. La ruta asciende al Refugio Urriellu antes de llegar a la Horcada Arenera, y luego continúa hacia las cumbres de la Torre de la Párdida y el Pico Boada.\n\nEl descenso transcurre por Jou Cerredo, Horcada Don Carlos, Horcada Caín y Jou Sin Tierre, regresando vía Refugio Urriellu y Pandébano. Esta ruta larga y extenuante requiere una excelente condición física y experiencia en terreno de montaña."}'::jsonb, 'Ehdecos', 23432, 2032, 2032, 2580, 1041, 'difficult', 'loop', 21960, 33840, 4132, '2022-09-17', '2022-08', '[{"lat":43.232964,"lng":-4.771403,"ele":1041.1},{"lat":43.233188,"lng":-4.770321,"ele":1041.8},{"lat":43.233249,"lng":-4.770297,"ele":1044},{"lat":43.233265,"lng":-4.770366,"ele":1044.6},{"lat":43.23329,"lng":-4.770418,"ele":1045.5},{"lat":43.233315,"lng":-4.77048,"ele":1046.4},{"lat":43.23331,"lng":-4.770549,"ele":1046.2},{"lat":43.233347,"lng":-4.770594,"ele":1047.5},{"lat":43.233378,"lng":-4.770652,"ele":1048.8},{"lat":43.233404,"lng":-4.770702,"ele":1049.8},{"lat":43.233431,"lng":-4.770765,"ele":1050.9},{"lat":43.233449,"lng":-4.770838,"ele":1051.6},{"lat":43.233467,"lng":-4.770896,"ele":1052.2},{"lat":43.23349,"lng":-4.770953,"ele":1053},{"lat":43.23353,"lng":-4.771002,"ele":1054.6},{"lat":43.233564,"lng":-4.771055,"ele":1056},{"lat":43.233595,"lng":-4.771108,"ele":1057.3},{"lat":43.233606,"lng":-4.771173,"ele":1057.6},{"lat":43.233638,"lng":-4.771222,"ele":1058.9},{"lat":43.233653,"lng":-4.771293,"ele":1059.4},{"lat":43.233669,"lng":-4.771354,"ele":1060},{"lat":43.233692,"lng":-4.771421,"ele":1061.1},{"lat":43.233698,"lng":-4.771488,"ele":1061.4},{"lat":43.233728,"lng":-4.771546,"ele":1062.9},{"lat":43.233748,"lng":-4.771607,"ele":1063.9},{"lat":43.23375,"lng":-4.771678,"ele":1064},{"lat":43.233768,"lng":-4.771743,"ele":1064.9},{"lat":43.233784,"lng":-4.771801,"ele":1065.6},{"lat":43.233792,"lng":-4.771879,"ele":1065.9},{"lat":43.233809,"lng":-4.771946,"ele":1066.5},{"lat":43.233828,"lng":-4.772004,"ele":1067.4},{"lat":43.233845,"lng":-4.772067,"ele":1068.2},{"lat":43.233863,"lng":-4.772127,"ele":1068.9},{"lat":43.233885,"lng":-4.772188,"ele":1069.8},{"lat":43.233901,"lng":-4.772257,"ele":1070.9},{"lat":43.23390