('wikiloc', '115067433', 'https://www.wikiloc.com/hiking-trails/tiros-santiago-115067433', 'Tiros Santiago', '{"en":"Short one-way ascent, moderate difficulty","ca":"Ascens curt d''un sol sentit, dificultat moderada","es":"Ascenso corto de un solo sentido, dificultad moderada"}'::jsonb, 'Tiros Santiago Hiking trail in Fuente Dé, Cantabria (España). Download its GPS track and follow the route on a map. Record your own itinerary from the Wikiloc app, upload the trail and share it with the community.', '{"en":"This one-way route to Tiros de Santiago offers a moderate ascent suitable for hikers looking for a direct approach to the summit. Starting from an unspecified point, the trail covers 7.4 km with 372 m of elevation gain.\n\nThe path leads steadily upwards, providing access to the Tiros de Santiago peak. While not overly long, the continuous climb requires a reasonable level of fitness. This route is ideal for those who prefer a focused summit attempt rather than a longer loop.","ca":"Aquesta ruta d''anada a Tiros de Santiago ofereix una pujada moderada adequada per a excursionistes que busquen una aproximació directa al cim. Partint d''un punt no especificat, el sender recorre 7,4 km amb 372 m de desnivell positiu.\n\nEl camí puja de manera constant, proporcionant accés al cim de Tiros de Santiago. Tot i no ser excessivament llarga, la pujada contínua requereix un nivell de forma física raonable. Aquesta ruta és ideal per a aquells que prefereixen un intent de cim concentrat en lloc d''una ruta circular més llarga.","es":"Esta ruta de ida a Tiros de Santiago ofrece un ascenso moderado adecuado para excursionistas que buscan una aproximación directa a la cumbre. Partiendo de un punto no especificado, el sendero cubre 7,4 km con 372 m de desnivel positivo.\n\nEl camino asciende de forma constante, proporcionando acceso a la cima de Tiros de Santiago. Aunque no es excesivamente larga, la subida continua requiere un nivel de forma física razonable. Esta ruta es ideal para aquellos que prefieren un intento de cumbre enfocado en lugar de una ruta circular más larga."}'::jsonb, 'J.C...', 7371, 372, 730, 2510, 1897, 'moderate', 'one-way', 9060, 16740, 1336, '2022-09-30', '2022-09', '[{"lat":43.180435,"lng":-4.806229,"ele":2259.6},{"lat":43.180485,"lng":-4.80621,"ele":2259.6},{"lat":43.180528,"lng":-4.80623,"ele":2263.1},{"lat":43.180571,"lng":-4.806257,"ele":2263.9},{"lat":43.180615,"lng":-4.806284,"ele":2264.3},{"lat":43.180663,"lng":-4.806302,"ele":2267.9},{"lat":43.18071,"lng":-4.80629,"ele":2268.5},{"lat":43.180756,"lng":-4.806293,"ele":2270.2},{"lat":43.180795,"lng":-4.806326,"ele":2269.9},{"lat":43.180841,"lng":-4.806345,"ele":2273},{"lat":43.180886,"lng":-4.806353,"ele":2274.6},{"lat":43.180921,"lng":-4.806398,"ele":2276.2},{"lat":43.18095,"lng":-4.806451,"ele":2277.7},{"lat":43.180944,"lng":-4.806524,"ele":2278.9},{"lat":43.180979,"lng":-4.80657,"ele":2279.2},{"lat":43.181006,"lng":-4.806622,"ele":2282.1},{"lat":43.181042,"lng":-4.80666,"ele":2284.1},{"lat":43.181084,"lng":-4.806699,"ele":2287},{"lat":43.18112,"lng":-4.806741,"ele":2287},{"lat":43.181157,"lng":-4.806778,"ele":2289},{"lat":43.181202,"lng":-4.806807,"ele":2291.1},{"lat":43.181249,"lng":-4.806837,"ele":2292.5},{"lat":43.181287,"lng":-4.806871,"ele":2294.4},{"lat":43.181326,"lng":-4.806902,"ele":2297.9},{"lat":43.181375,"lng":-4.806921,"ele":2297.7},{"lat":43.18142,"lng":-4.806932,"ele":2300.5},{"lat":43.18147,"lng":-4.806913,"ele":2302.5},{"lat":43.181515,"lng":-4.806882,"ele":2301.7},{"lat":43.181562,"lng":-4.806866,"ele":2308.6},{"lat":43.181615,"lng":-4.806873,"ele":2313.6},{"lat":43.18166,"lng":-4.806892,"ele":2315.7},{"lat":43.181703,"lng":-4.806925,"ele":2317.5},{"lat":43.181736,"lng":-4.806873,"ele":2317.1},{"lat":43.181783,"lng":-4.80686,"ele":2317.7},{"lat":43.18183,"lng":-4.806855,"ele":2318.3},{"lat":43.181873,"lng":-4.806884,"ele":2318.1},{"lat":43.181896,"lng":-4.806944,"ele":2319.1},{"lat":43.181905,"lng":-4.807014,"ele":2320.9},{"lat":43.18192,"l